A registry shall be kept of all persons practicing massage on the premises of such massage therapy business, which shall be available for inspection by an authorized agent of the City, including, but not limited to, the City Chief Financial Officer, the authorized designee of the City Chief Financial Officer and City Police Officers. The registry required by this section shall be made available for inspection during normal hours of business and must provide the following information:
